Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed 85 aisles per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six seven eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,88 aisles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,12 minutes remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be crossing the\Ndeadline in 10 minutes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.30,0:01:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only have 12 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it spectacular wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Your men are all\Ngoing to die along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're perfectly prepared for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to an absolutely\Nbeautiful rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.94,0:02:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a blonde man in a red coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, this place is crawling\Nwith those bad lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this just isn't my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.11,0:02:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you save me? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you really mean to say is thank\Nyou for saving me, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know-It-All, what are the\Nbaddie laddies gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well it's not good you mean into\Nthe canyon they're gonna drop the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,steamer oh man why can't i just get\Na break death and poverty like me so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much they brought friends oh yeah\Nand then there's the insurance girls
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it never ends ow why why did i say\Nthat why did i say it was my dad's ship
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shit why do i even care\Nabout this stupid rig
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my dad was just a good\Nfor nothing workaholic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, can I at least\Nask where we're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not the time to be\Nworrying about things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much more important that you\Nkeep some room in your brain open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stopping this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, my friend, are going to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't this the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the blueprint of the\NFlourish, this steamer. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:03:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you able to get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just something I copied from my\Ndad's workplace when I was a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's reproduced all the way\Ndown to the tiniest scribbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have had a lot\Nof respect for your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kite?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kite, you must become the kind of\Nperson who does things for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for me, I was able to do\Nit with the sand steamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what you'll devote\Nyour life to, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have it, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is someone like me supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do for a living\Nwhere I can help people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you getting all\Nsentimental on me for,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you little squirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:04:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to survive. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't it explode? Is it a dud?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a haul!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we've got some guns to play with!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we get to the end, make a right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are all voice tubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you really think this will work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the ball's in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to see if they pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got us, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even better than a dime novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, we're actually\Ngoing to have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.78,0:06:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if our little\Nfriend really sparkles
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention scumbags if you slack\Noff till timeout, I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drag that blonde bastard up\Nhere or else It's my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at the starboard passenger cabins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the blonde guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.69,0:06:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold him right there\NI'll send you some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hitting himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His speed is incredible Oh,\Njeez, what a shoe of a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll be able to\Nfigure out where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how will I contact you to let you\Nknow where they're going to be, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't this... It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is talk\Ninto it and I'll hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be caught in some\Nshootout in a narrow passageway,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to be counting on your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with\Nthis lost technology?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technology just who the\Nhell are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd explain it to you, but you\Nwouldn't believe me besides.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry so much\Nabout the little details.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash you okay? No guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't supposed to start like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:07:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I screwed up They're bleeding badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to help them. Help\Nthem? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you actually saying that you've purposely\Navoided killing them the entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how good a shot you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless you shoot to kill, you're\Ngonna get yourself killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it is kind of\Na stupid approach, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is very sloppy of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.18,0:08:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I put out even one flame of\Nlife, it would make her sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something happening in the\Ncentral stairway on third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Port passenger cabin team, head around\Nbehind the central stairway quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody on floors one through five,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,position yourselves around\Neach stairway and close in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get there, you\Nshould speed right across.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gathering above\Nand below you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta stop being so\Nsoft with those bad lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being so damn soft\Nwith the entire human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am betrayed, and they am betrayed, and\Nwe all and a lot of innocent people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for us to go back\Nnow, and they're too damn clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you should start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the future is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's broken past the\Ncentral engineers cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real tough bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's also got The devil's luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do? Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that luck\Nhas anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There should be a stairway on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it all the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only unmanned place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the party hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You arrived just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust that my brilliant\Ndirections were clear enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kite, you've got to get\Nout of that room immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like the way you sparkled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.85,0:11:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're a worthy opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:11:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you no longer afraid of dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found him, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, you pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave us a lot of trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're all out of tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, it's a real accomplishment\Nthat your rag team made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the simple fact is, reality\Nis almost never that beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually do feel for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vaya con Dios.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been particularly\Nfond of this method,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seemed to be the quickest\Nand easiest way to get past you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Meryl Stryfe from the\NBernardelli Insurance Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, in some places, I happen to\Nbe better known as Derringer Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with us, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Millie Thompson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, let's see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose for the time being, you\Ncan just call me Stun Gun Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna let you off easy this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only because we don't seem\Nto have a lot of time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect you'll act like\Na reasonable adult and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take care of them quickly\Nwithout screwing around,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.07,0:13:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.99,0:13:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my friend, it looks like our\Ntime together is running short.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's taking a real beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt it'll last very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you and your\Nguys go down with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drop you right now, Clonty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's find out just\Nwho sparkles the most between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots, stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll settle it with\Nan old-fashioned duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in, and if I win this\Nshowdown, will you stop the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Engine temperature is abnormal, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hull is screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we can do at this point is bet on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's rather\Ntrine and old-fashioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what do you say we start\Nright when this car hits the deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BIRDS CHIRP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they both hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:16:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for jumping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can handle that in the shape you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna finish him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss! Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maramita, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tore his own wounds open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should finish him anyway, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too soft-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, use those huge dynamos of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I've mentioned so many times before,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a pain defended to the death\Nis a name worthy of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, Vash won the duo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit them now! Aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good they won't engage, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the impact damage\Nthe hydraulic system?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unconfirmed, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm getting abnormal\Npressure readings in the boiler!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it gets much higher than this,\Nthe entire hole will explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Force the engines to a\Nfull stop immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believe you were
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting in that condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:16:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get that looked after quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've We've got an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been a system malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.10,0:17:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've lost the steering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need kite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a way to shut the engines down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd have to power down\Nthe system manually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where can we even do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship is so old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an engine room, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an emergency stop lever inside\Nthe control system, but access is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you\Nknow, you little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget watching my fellow crew
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mate as he was killed\Nright in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not accept help from you\Nwe will stop the ship ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kite, what are you going to do, Kite?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit bugging me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has come for me to pay\Nthe price for what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only 4,500 yards left till the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,4,000 yards remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3,500 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a cellar in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2,500.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.06,0:18:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't working, dammit! It won't punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There just isn't any way we can\Nget through this mass of pipes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1,800.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on. It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down. There's a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The emergency stop system\Nhas been activated, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.90,0:19:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many yards do we have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,800!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just going too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nasty's selfless act of\Nheroism, we were all saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neon did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just paid off my wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time we meet,\Nit's no holds barred.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take that life of yours. Count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That smug jerk laid it on us\Nreal thick all the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, on the first evening of Pebble,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From somewhere out of nowhere\Ndrops upon the dreaming world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.94,0:21:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sooooooooooo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That song. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's an old song, but I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good song, so shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right. It's a good song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From somewhere out of nowhere\Ndrops upon the dreaming world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:21:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same song that she loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, will you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.04,0:22:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making me cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHH!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What made up front of me, a-fif-fuckhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.22,0:22:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I meant you were hearing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you flaky show-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of flaky show-off?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.10,0:22:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you're not gonna be anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.68,0:22:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.12,0:24:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met a lone man in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.42,0:24:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a traveling priest, Nicholas D. Wolfwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He smiled, and then he told\Nme that I'm a troubled man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faced with his all-seeing smile, there\Nwas nothing I could say in my defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.18,0:24:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I meet this man\Nbecause I was destined to?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.62,0:24:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was it simply by a small gist of God?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man's name is Nicholas D.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.16,0:24:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood, a traveling\Npriest I met in the desert.

